@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:security;architecture] injected-github-read-loaders-keep-the-supplied-authority
Canonical loaders entered with an explicit GitHub read port MUST perform every
nested request, diff fallback and full-file read through that same port. They MUST
NOT select an AppState, cached private snapshot, environment token, CLI credential or
new source while loading. The legacy state wrappers MUST preserve their established
policy and the canonical DTOs, complete inventories and captured revision checks.
Source: Tavi's 22 Oct personal-tenant Review adapter completion instruction and
21 Oct tenant credential/source-isolation requirements.

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:security;architecture] workspace-context-captures-repository-identity
Personal workspace AI context assembly MUST capture every selected repository's
current immutable ID with the captured credential before provider publication. It
MUST reject a changed saved/captured ID, conflicting IDs for one repository name or
a metadata response naming a different repository. Case aliases MUST be deduplicated
within each bounded validation phase. Source: confirmed ce-code-review findings 4
and 5 and Tavi's 25 Oct 2026 assigned fix batch.
